a/learning/raccoon-heist-claude.webp","Raccoon Heist gameplay with a 3D backyard, the player raccoon, collectible loot, and a countdown HUD.","A night in the backyard: loot, patrols, and a race back to the dumpster.","https://simonw.github.io/raccoon-heist/","assets/media/learning/tower-of-time-ai-build.webp","Tower of Time gameplay, showing a pixel-art space station, the player ship, an enemy, and base health.","The playable battlefield behind the author’s rewind-mechanic prompts.","https://m4v3k.itch.io/tower-of-time","assets/media/learning/claude-agent-team-tetris.webp","Tetris in play, showing colored blocks, the next piece, score, and keyboard controls.","The agent team’s finished game, with real-time board and score.","https://caiguanhao.github.io/tetris/","assets/media/learning/tron-exonix-claude.webp","The neon TRON: EXONIX game board with a player vehicle, moving enemies, and territory boundaries.","The live Godot build: neon territory capture and moving enemies.","https://www.top3d.ai/demo/exonix-build/index.html","assets/media/learning/moonlight-mayhem-codex.webp","A playable raccoon character in a 3D museum, with crew rescue objectives and security patrols.","Inside the museum: crew rescue, security, and the Golden Sardine.","https://simonw.github.io/raccoon-heist-codex/","assets/media/learning/polar-icecapade-claude.webp","Polar Icecapade’s first icy 3D arena after melee propulsion and a shot, showing the moving character, gates, coins, timer and 11 of 12 ammunition.","The live first level after melee movement and a shot; ammo has fallen to 11/12.","https://evankurtzart.itch.io/polar-icecapade","origin","browser-capture","2026-10-20","assets/media/learning/katana-kitsune-godot.webp","The creator’s Katana Kitsune combat screenshot with an isometric courtyard, the party, enemies, health bars and minimap.","Creator-published combat screenshot from the silent Godot prototype.","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/blob/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c9624