Map/assets/media/learning/cursor-destruction-derby.webp",[1257],"Cursor",[1259],{"_841":1260,"_809":1261,"_870":1262},"Read the Cursor development statement","https://github.com/littleearth/vibe-coded-games#development","Primary author disclosure covers the two individually named games and credits Cursor for their development.",[1264],{"_841":1265,"_809":1266,"_870":1267},"Open the complete derby project","https://github.com/littleearth/vibe-coded-games/tree/main/demoderby","Includes the complete arena’s HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Vehicles and arena visuals are drawn in code; open demoderby/index.html locally.",[1269],{"_841":1270,"_809":348,"_870":1271},"Play Destruction Derby Arena","Desktop keyboard recommended. Player 1 uses WASD and Space; player 2 uses arrow keys and Enter.",[1273],{"_841":1042,"_809":1274,"_870":-7},"https://github.com/littleearth/vibe-coded-games#destruction-derby-arena",[1276,1277,1278,1279],"Try the arena and compare single-player and local multiplayer behavior.","Read the creator’s AI contribution statement.","Inspect demoderby/game.js to follow car movement, damage, and opponent behavior.","Tune one vehicle parameter and test collisions with both players.","The author attributes the collection to Cursor AI and identifies this derby as a child’s AI-assisted creation. No detailed prompt history is supplied.",[1276,1277,1278,1279],{"_841":1042,"_809":1274,"_802":891},{"_841":1270,"_809":348,"_802":974,"_870":1271},{"_841":1265,"_809":1266,"_870":1267,"_932":933},{"_841":1260,"_809":1261,"_870":1262},[],"example:cursor-space-shooter","Space Shooter: a family Cursor experiment","A complete top-down arcade shooter with enemy waves, health pickups, weapon upgrades, and procedural sound.","/examples/cursor-space-shooter/",{"_804":121,"_805":1288,"_807":1289,"_920":919,"_916":922,"_912":923,"_908":1334,"_901":1335,"_892":1336,"_881":1337,"_816":1338,"_867":1339,"_857":1340},[1293,1294,1295,1296,1297,1298,1299,1300,1301,1302,1303,1304,1305,1306,13