SURGE for Oinja","https://oinja-game.vercel.app/","Desktop WebGL and keyboard. WASD/arrows move, Space dodges, Q releases Sync Burst, and E interacts. Attacks are automatic. English and Chinese; no mobile touch controls.",[5101],{"_841":1467,"_809":539,"_870":-7},[5103,5104,5105,5106],"Start a run and try movement, dodging and automatic attacks.","Read the creator’s contribution disclosure.","Inspect combat, progression and map code under src/surge/.","Change one ability combination and check its effect during a new run.","Olivia used GPT-6 Astra in Codex for combat, ability synergies, procedural environments, interface and debugging. The original Oinja universe, creative direction and playtest feedback came from the creator; development involved repeated sessions and revisions.","Three.js · Rapier 3D · TypeScript",[5103,5104,5105,5106],{"_841":1467,"_809":539,"_802":891},{"_841":5097,"_809":5098,"_802":974,"_870":5099},{"_841":5092,"_809":5093,"_932":933,"_870":5094},{"_841":5088,"_809":539,"_870":5089},[696,931],"example:project-plateau","Project Plateau: Proof Before Dark","A first-person field-photography expedition inspired by The Lost World: frame prehistoric animals, manage four photographic plates, avoid threats and return to camp before daylight fades.","/examples/project-plateau/",{"_804":43,"_805":5116,"_807":5117,"_920":5173,"_2871":5174,"_916":1051,"_908":5171,"_901":5175,"_892":5176,"_881":5177,"_816":5178,"_867":5179,"_857":5180,"_912":923},[5121,5122,5123,5124,5125,5126,5127,5128,5129,5130,5131,5132,5133,5134,5135,5136,5137,5138,5139,5140,5141],{"_837":805,"_843":5116,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":5117,"_839":807,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":918,"_843":5173,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":2868,"_898":2869,"_851":5172,"_839":2871,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":914,"_843":1049,"_839":916,"_858":917},{"_837":838,"_841":910,"_843":911,"_839":912,"_858":913},{"_837":838,"_841":906,"_843":5171,"_839":908,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":897,"_898":899,"_851":5166,"_839":901,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":893,"_851":5163,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":890,"_843":1211,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":888,"_843":979,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":882,"_851":5158,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":879,"_843":974,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":874,"_851":5153,"_839":816,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":872,"_843":873,"_839":816,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":865,"_851":5148,"_839":867,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":855,"_851":5146,"_839":857,"_858":-7},{"_837":849,"_839":11,"_841":850,"_851":5145},{"_837":844,"_839":845,"_841":543,"_191":5144,"_193":542,"_816":544,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_847":1374},{"_837":838,"_839":1371,"_841":1372,"_843":243},{"_837":854,"_839":1367,"_841":1368,"_851":5142},[5143],{"_841":1368,"_809":545},"/GameMap/assets/media/learning/project-plateau.webp",[1779],[5147],{"_841":861,"_809":862},[5149],{"_841":5150,"_809":5151,"_870":5152},"Read the creator’s adaptation and QA account","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game#what-the-qa-record-admits-it-did-not-test","The author explains the recorded camera-to-result-and-restart route and its limits; GameMap is not claiming to have reproduced that complete route.",[5154],{"_841":5155,"_809":5156,"_870":5157},"Open the full expedition project","https://github.com/zenstory-ai/novel-to-game/tree/main/examples/project-plateau","Three.js/Vite game with local runtime models, textures, sound, source adaptation documents and QA inputs. Requires Node 22.12+ for local tooling. Blender scripts are asset-production sources, not required for normal play.",[5159],{"_841":5160,"_809":5161,"_870":5162},"Play Project Plateau","https://plateau.vibecoco.ai/","Desktop landscape browser with WebGL2, keyboard and mouse. Mobile devices may show the creator’s short recorded preview instead of the full game.",[5164],{"_841":5165,"_809":5156,"_870":-7},"Read the expedition build and design workspace",[5167,5168,5169,5170],"Start the desktop expedition and learn movement, camera, crouching and return-to-camp controls.","Compare how subject framing, cover and photographic plates create choices from the novel’s expedition premise.","Read the build brief and verification record to separate a tested route from untested device, sound and optional encounter behavior.","For local play, enter examples/project-plateau/build/app, use Node 22.12+ to install dependencies, then run npm start; the committed runtime assets do not require Blender regeneration.","The creator presents Project Plateau as a NovelToGame adaptation built through analysis, concept, world design, art direction, implementation and QA stages. The public workspace includes game code, committed models and textures, asset-generation scripts and the input trace for one tested path; its coding client is not explicitly identified.",[2843],"Three.js · WebGL2",[2843],[5167,5168,5169,5170],{"_841":5165,"_809":5156,"_802":1230},{"_841":5160,"_809":5161,"_802":974,"_870":5162},{"_841":5155,"_809":5156,"_870":5157,"_932":933},{"_841":5150,"_809":5151,"_870":5152},[931],"example:isocity-cursor","IsoCity","Build an isometric city with zoning, roads, rail, utilities and a simulated population. IsoCity is a complete Canvas-based browser game that its creator attributes to Cursor.","/examples/isocity-cursor/",{"_804":41,"_805":5182,"_807":5183,"_920":4345,"_916":922,"_912":923,"_908":5228,"_901":5229,"_892":5230,"_881":5231,"_816":5232,"_867":5233,"_857":5234},[5187,5188,5189,5190,5191,5192,5193,5194,5195,5196,5197,5198,5199,5200,5201,5202,5203,5204,5205],{"_837":805,"_843":5182,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":5183,"_839":807,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":918,"_843":4345,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":914,"_843":915,"_839":916,"_858":917},{"_837":838,"_841":910,"_843":911,"_839":912,"_858":913},{"_837":838,"_841":906,"_843":5228,"_839":908,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":897,"_898":899,"_851":5223,"_839":901,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":893,"_851":5221,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":890,"_843":891,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":888,"_843":979,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":882,"_851":5216,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":879,"_843":974,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":874,"_851":5213,"_839":816,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":872,"_843":873,"_839":816,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":865,"_851":5210,"_839":867,"_858":-7},{"_837":849,"_839":11,"_841":850,"_851":5209},{"_837":844,"_839":845,"_841":548,"_191":5208,"_193":547,"_816":481,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_847":1374},{"_837":838,"_839":1371,"_841":1372,"_843":243},{"_837":854,"_839":1367,"_841":1368,"_851":5206},[5207],{"_841":1368,"_809":549},"/GameMap/assets/media/learning/isocity-cursor.webp",[1257],[5211],{"_841":3907,"_809":481,"_870":5212},"Author README presents both IsoCity and IsoCoaster together and directly names Cursor. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[5214],{"_841":1457,"_809":4330,"_870":5215},"Complete Next.js/TypeScript game with renderer, simulation, UI and public assets; npm install then npm run dev opens the city at localhost:3000. Current package uses Next 16; use a compatible current Node runtime. MIT code.",[5217],{"_841":5218,"_809":5219,"_870":5220},"Play IsoCity","https://iso-city.com","Author-hosted browser city builder with pointer and touch support.",[5222],{"_841":3920,"_809":481,"_870":-7},[5224,5225,5226,5227],"Play the city builder and follow how roads, zoning and utilities affect growth.","Run the repository locally and locate the CanvasIsometricGrid renderer and city state.","Trace one system, such as train routing, pedestrian paths or the economy, from input to visible behavior.","Change one simulation rule with an agent, then compare its behavior and save/load flow with the original.","The creator identifies Cursor as the development tool. The public README does not name a model, quantify generated code, or publish a prompt transcript; study it as an AI-assisted city-building project.",[5224,5225,5226,5227],{"_841":3920,"_809":481,"_802":891},{"_841":5218,"_809":5219,"_802":974,"_870":5220},{"_841":1457,"_809":4330,"_870":5215,"_932":933},{"_841":3907,"_809":481,"_870":5212},[],"example:butch-graves-j2me","Butch Graves 3D","Fight through five Halloween shooter episodes with bosses, keys, secrets and scripted cutscenes, rendered by a compact raycasting engine for Java feature phones.","/examples/butch-graves-j2me/",{"_804":39,"_805":5236,"_807":5237,"_920":5288,"_916":1051,"_912":923,"_908":5287,"_901":5289,"_892":5290,"_881":5291,"_816":5292,"_867":5293,"_857":5294},[5241,5242,5243,5244,5245,5246,5247,5248,5249,5250,5251,5252,5253,5254,5255,5256,5257,5258,5259],{"_837":805,"_843":5236,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":5237,"_839":807,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":918,"_843":5288,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":914,"_843":1049,"_839":916,"_858":917},{"_837":838,"_841":910,"_843":911,"_839":912,"_858":913},{"_837":838,"_841":906,"_843":5287,"_839":908,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":897,"_898":899,"_851":5282,"_839":901,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":893,"_851":5279,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":890,"_843":1211,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":888,"_843":5278,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":882,"_851":5273,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":879,"_843":880,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":874,"_851":5269,"_839":816,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":872,"_843":873,"_839":816,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":865,"_851":5264,"_839":867,"_858":-7},{"_837":849,"_839":11,"_841":850,"_851":5263},{"_837":844,"_839":845,"_841":552,"_191":5262,"_193":551,"_816":553,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_847":1374},{"_837":838,"_839":1371,"_841":1372,"_843":243},{"_837":854,"_839":1367,"_841":1368,"_851":5260},[5261],{"_841":1368,"_809":554},"/GameMap/assets/media/learning/butch-graves-j2me.webp",[1023],[5265],{"_841":5266,"_809":5267,"_870":5268},"Read the human and Claude contribution disclosure","https://github.com/WollyMonjac/ButchGraves3D#butch-graves-3d","The creator explicitly distinguishes human briefs, direction and real-device playtests from the model’s implementation and asset tools. Exact Claude client is not identified; the cloud sandbox alone does not establish Claude Code.",[5270],{"_841":5271,"_809":553,"_870":5272},"Open the complete J2ME game and assets","Full Java game, level/resource packs, procedural art/audio tools, tests and packaged full/lite builds. Rebuilding needs JDK8, a MIDP2.0/CLDC1.0 API JAR, ProGuard and the toolchain paths documented in DEVELOPER.md. No repository code license is declared; fonts retain SIL OFL terms.",[5274],{"_841":5275,"_809":5276,"_870":5277},"Download Butch Graves 3D","https://github.com/WollyMonjac/ButchGraves3D/tree/main/dist","Ready-built v2.3.0 JAR/JAD files: full game1.7MB or lite build994KB without voices. Requires a compatible MIDP2.0 phone or J2ME Loader, KEmulator or FreeJ2ME; it does not launch with ordinary java -jar. Keypad2/8 moves,4/6 turns,1/3 strafes,5 fires,0 uses,7/9 switches weapons,# jumps and* opens the map. Binary downloaded and inspected, but not executed.","Downloadable build",[5280],{"_841":5281,"_809":553,"_870":-7},"Read the creator’s build and testing account",[5283,5284,5285,5286],"Download the full or lite JAR and open it in a compatible J2ME emulator or MIDP 2.0 phone.","Try moving, turning, firing, using doors and switching weapons during the opening episode.","Read the creator’s implementation account and compare src/E.java with the generated resource packs.","Change one level or resource, follow DEVELOPER.md to rebuild, and verify the phone API, memory and audio constraints on the target runtime.","WollyMonjac credits Claude Opus 5.5 with code, levels, art and audio tools. The human supplied the brief and direction, played builds and reported problems; the creator also explains simulator, emulator and real-device testing separately.","Custom fixed-point raycaster · Java MIDP 2.0 / CLDC 1.0",[5283,5284,5285,5286],{"_841":5281,"_809":553,"_802":1230},{"_841":5275,"_809":5276,"_802":880,"_870":5277},{"_841":5271,"_809":553,"_932":933,"_870":5272},{"_841":5266,"_809":5267,"_870":5268},[],"example:pixel-orchard-astra","Pixel Orchard · Memory Harvest","Turn over twelve seed packets to find six matching symbol pairs. Track moves, remember mismatches and reshuffle the garden for another short round.","/examples/pixel-orchard-astra/",{"_804":37,"_805":5296,"_807":5297,"_920":5344,"_916":922,"_912":1743,"_908":5343,"_901":5345,"_892":5346,"_881":5347,"_816":5348,"_867":5349,"_857":5350},[5301,5302,5303,5304,5305,5306,5307,5308,5309,5310,5311,5312,5313,5314,5315,5316,5317,5318],{"_837":805,"_843":5296,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":5297,"_839":807,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":918,"_843":5344,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":914,"_843":915,"_839":916,"_858":917},{"_837":838,"_841":910,"_843":1742,"_839":912,"_858":913},{"_837":838,"_841":906,"_843":5343,"_839":908,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":897,"_898":899,"_851":5338,"_839":901,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":893,"_851":5334,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":890,"_843":2219,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":888,"_843":979,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":882,"_851":5330,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":879,"_843":974,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":874,"_851":5326,"_839":816,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":872,"_843":873,"_839":816,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":865,"_851":5321,"_839":867,"_858":-7},{"_837":849,"_839":11,"_841":850,"_851":5320},{"_837":844,"_839":845,"_841":557,"_191":5319,"_193":556,"_816":558,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_847":960},{"_837":838,"_839":840,"_841":842,"_843":243},"/GameMap/assets/media/learning/pixel-orchard-astra.webp",[1779],[5322],{"_841":5323,"_809":5324,"_870":5325},"Read the creator’s generation disclosure","https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/README.md","The author describes these as Astra-generated standalone HTML studies; this particular entry includes a complete playable memory-game loop and its exact prompt.",[5327],{"_841":1457,"_809":5328,"_870":5329},"https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/013-pixel-orchard.html","The single HTML file contains the entire game, inline CSS, shuffled deck, matching, move counter and reset logic. It opens offline without assets, packages or a build step. No explicit code license was observed.",[5331],{"_841":5332,"_809":558,"_870":5333},"Play Pixel Orchard","English interface; click, tap or focus card buttons with the keyboard. PLANT AGAIN reshuffles and resets the round. No login, installation or network dependencies after loading.",[5335],{"_841":5336,"_809":5337,"_870":-7},"Read the exact game prompt","https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/GPT-6-Astra-100-HTML-Files/blob/main/013-pixel-orchard.txt",[5339,5340,5341,5342],"Flip two cards and watch how matches and mismatches behave.","Compare the exact prompt with the complete inline implementation.","Inspect shuffle, turn locking and reset during a delayed mismatch.","Change the deck and complete a round, then verify reset and keyboard access.","MiaAI-Lab identifies the collection as GPT-6 Astra-generated and preserves this game’s exact prompt. The prompt specifies complete matching, reset and rapid-input behavior; the particular chat or coding client and manual refinement are not disclosed.","DOM/CSS · Vanilla JavaScript",[5339,5340,5341,5342],{"_841":5336,"_809":5337,"_802":2219},{"_841":5332,"_809":558,"_802":974,"_870":5333},{"_841":1457,"_809":5328,"_932":933,"_870":5329},{"_841":5323,"_809":5324,"_870":5325},[],"example:fruit-ninja-dojo-astra","Fruit Ninja Dojo · One More Slice","Swipe through airborne fruit, chain slices and dodge bombs in an unofficial Fruit Ninja recreation with Classic, sixty-second Arcade and ninety-second Zen modes.","/examples/fruit-ninja-dojo-astra/",{"_804":35,"_805":5352,"_80