ved.",[5387],{"_841":5388,"_809":562,"_870":5389},"Play Fruit Ninja Dojo","Chinese interface; hold and drag the mouse or swipe to slice. Space pauses/resumes, Esc closes dialogs, and M toggles audio. No login or installation.",[5391],{"_841":5392,"_809":5380,"_870":-7},"Read the creator’s original Astra post",[5394,5395,5396,5397],"Choose Zen mode and slice a group of fruit.","Read the author’s original post and source-sharing follow-up.","Inspect gesture sampling, fixed-step physics and procedural fruit drawing.","Change one scoring or spawn rule and test pause, retry and saved records.","Laplace9 says an initial high-reasoning Astra prompt produced the game and later shared the full source. The current repository includes subsequent refinements and tests; the original one-shot claim does not prove every current line came from that prompt.","Canvas 2D · Vanilla JavaScript · HTML/CSS UI",[5394,5395,5396,5397],{"_841":5392,"_809":5380,"_802":891},{"_841":5388,"_809":562,"_802":974,"_870":5389},{"_841":1457,"_809":5384,"_932":933,"_870":5385},{"_841":5379,"_809":5380,"_870":5381},[],"example:thunderfall-astra","THUNDERFALL · Skyward Expedition","Choose one of three fighters and weave through five sectors of drifting bullets, lasers and bosses. Collect four weapon colors and pick upgrades between stages.","/examples/thunderfall-astra/",{"_804":33,"_805":5407,"_807":5408,"_920":5459,"_916":922,"_912":923,"_908":5458,"_901":5460,"_892":5461,"_881":5462,"_816":5463,"_867":5464,"_857":5465},[5412,5413,5414,5415,5416,5417,5418,5419,5420,5421,5422,5423,5424,5425,5426,5427,5428,5429,5430],{"_837":805,"_843":5407,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":5408,"_839":807,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":918,"_843":5459,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":914,"_843":915,"_839":916,"_858":917},{"_837":838,"_841":910,"_843":911,"_839":912,"_858":913},{"_837":838,"_841":906,"_843":5458,"_839":908,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":897,"_898":899,"_851":5453,"_839":901,"_858":-7},{"_8