ain/works/thunderfall/PROMPT.md",[5454,5455,5456,5457],"Choose a fighter and start the opening sector.","Read the original request separately from the reconstructed reuse specification.","Inspect the game engine, procedural airframes and rendering modules.","Change one bullet pattern and test bombs, pause and a stage transition.","The creator publishes the request and reports GPT-6 Astra ultra participation across design, implementation, procedural visuals, synthesized audio and review. It was iterated with collaborating agents; the exact coding client is not explicitly named.","Canvas 2D · Vanilla JavaScript · Web Audio",[5454,5455,5456,5457],{"_841":5451,"_809":5452,"_802":2219},{"_841":5446,"_809":5447,"_802":974,"_870":5448},{"_841":1457,"_809":5442,"_932":933,"_870":5443},{"_841":5437,"_809":5438,"_870":5439},[],"example:nagi-home-cowork","Nagi Home","Care for Nagi, a small crab living in a procedural home: place food, throw a ball, request furniture activities and follow a diary as daily needs change. It is a quiet life simulation with saved progress.","/examples/nagi-home-cowork/",{"_804":31,"_805":5467,"_807":5468,"_920":5517,"_916":1051,"_912":923,"_908":5516,"_901":5518,"_892":5519,"_881":5520,"_816":5521,"_867":5522,"_857":5523},[5472,5473,5474,5475,5476,5477,5478,5479,5480,5481,5482,5483,5484,5485,5486,5487,5488,5489,5490],{"_837":805,"_843":5467,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":5468,"_839":807,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":918,"_843":5517,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":914,"_843":1049,"_839":916,"_858":917},{"_837":838,"_841":910,"_843":911,"_839":912,"_858":913},{"_837":838,"_841":906,"_843":5516,"_839":908,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":897,"_898":899,"_851":5511,"_839":901,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":893,"_851":5508,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":890,"_843":891,"_839":892,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":888,"_843":979,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":882,"_851":5504,"_839":881,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":879,"_8