ory/SKILL.md, its implementation reference, and .claude/hooks/validate-commit.sh. These are agent instructions and executable shell validation hooks; src/ contains only a placeholder and CLAUDE.md, not a game runtime.",[7197],{"_841":6414,"_809":7198},"https://github.com/Donchitos/Claude-Code-Game-Studios/blob/be8993bbc5a1f016bc770b2846ce06272d284526/.claude/skills/dev-story/SKILL.md",[7200],{"_841":6419,"_809":7201},"https://github.com/Donchitos/Claude-Code-Game-Studios/blob/be8993bbc5a1f016bc770b2846ce06272d284526/.claude/skills/dev-story/references/4-implement.md",[7203],{"_841":6424,"_809":7204},"https://github.com/Donchitos/Claude-Code-Game-Studios","Godot / Unity / Unreal Engine",[1190],[694],"agent:codex-roblox-studio-bridge","codex-roblox-studio-bridge","Codex ↔ Roblox Studio bridge","A local Python server and Roblox Studio plugin let Codex create objects, change scripts, run Luau, and communicate through an in-editor chat panel.","/agents/codex-roblox-studio-bridge/",{"_804":7209,"_805":7210,"_802":6663,"_3":7243,"_920":7241,"_6434":7211,"_197":7240,"_6421":7237,"_6416":7234,"_6413":6665,"_6410":7231,"_6407":7230,"_6404":7229,"_6401":2869,"_6398":200},[7215,7216,7217,7218,7219,7220,7221,7222,7223,7224,7225,7226,7227,7228],{"_837":805,"_843":7210,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":7211,"_839":6434,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6432,"_843":6662,"_839":802,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":6430,"_898":2869,"_851":7242,"_839":3,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6428,"_843":7241,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":854,"_841":6424,"_851":7238,"_839":197,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":6419,"_851":7235,"_839":6421,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":6414,"_851":7232,"_839":6416,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6411,"_843":6650,"_839":6413,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6408,"_843":7231,"_839":6410,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6405,"_843":7230,"_839":6407,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6402,"_843":7229,"_839":6404,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6399,"_843":6460,"_839":6401,"_858"