e Unreal MCP surface, with a project-context session hook.","/agents/epic-unreal-claude-skills/",{"_804":7351,"_805":7352,"_802":6477,"_3":7384,"_920":6810,"_6434":7353,"_197":7382,"_6421":7379,"_6416":7376,"_6410":7373,"_6407":7372,"_6401":899,"_6413":6517,"_6404":7371,"_6398":200},[7357,7358,7359,7360,7361,7362,7363,7364,7365,7366,7367,7368,7369,7370],{"_837":805,"_843":7352,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":7353,"_839":6434,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6432,"_843":6476,"_839":802,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":6430,"_898":2869,"_851":7383,"_839":3,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6428,"_843":6810,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":854,"_841":6424,"_851":7380,"_839":197,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":6419,"_851":7377,"_839":6421,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":6414,"_851":7374,"_839":6416,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6411,"_843":6504,"_839":6413,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6408,"_843":7373,"_839":6410,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6405,"_843":7372,"_839":6407,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6402,"_843":7371,"_839":6404,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6399,"_843":6400,"_839":6401,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6397,"_843":200,"_839":6398,"_858":917},"Epic Games","Requires a running Unreal Editor with ModelContextProtocol and AllToolsets enabled. The plugin does not ship static MCP configuration; generate it from the editor. Tool search exposes list_toolsets, describe_toolset, and call_tool by default. The Python execution tool can mutate or delete project content, and localhost does not exclude other same-user processes. Keep client approvals enabled. Windows needs Git Bash or WSL for the session-context hook. Only Claude Code is documented by this plugin.","Verified public skill/reference files for unreal-mcp, create-toolset, and unreal-skill, plus executable hooks/unreal-context.sh and Claude plugin metadata. This repository contains agent instructions and hook code; Unreal's engine-side ModelContextProtocol/AllToolsets implementation is not bundled.",[7375],{"_841":6414,"_809":7376},"https://github.com/EpicGames/unreal-engine-skills-for-claude-code-plugin/blob/main/README.md",[7378],{"_841":6419,"_809":7379},"https://github.com/EpicGames/unreal-engine-skills-for-claude-code-plugin/tree/main/skills",[7381],{"_841":6424,"_809":7382},"https://github.com/EpicGames/unreal-engine-skills-for-claude-code-plugin",[1190],[694],"agent:gemini-cli-cloud-crush-source","gemini-cli-cloud-crush-source","Cloud Crush: Google’s Gemini CLI game source and codelab","Google publishes a complete match-3 game explicitly attributed to Gemini CLI, alongside a codelab covering plan mode, model steering, browser adaptation, testing, and subagents. The repository includes the resulting game rather than only instructions to generate one.","/agents/gemini-cli-cloud-crush-source/",{"_804":7386,"_805":7387,"_802":7278,"_3":7417,"_920":7415,"_6434":7388,"_197":3618,"_6421":3608,"_6416":3603,"_6410":7408,"_6407":7407,"_6401":899,"_6413":6665,"_6404":7406,"_6398":200},[7392,7393,7394,7395,7396,7397,7398,7399,7400,7401,7402,7403,7404,7405],{"_837":805,"_843":7387,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":7388,"_839":6434,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6432,"_843":7277,"_839":802,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":6430,"_898":2869,"_851":7416,"_839":3,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6428,"_843":7415,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":854,"_841":6424,"_851":7413,"_839":197,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":6419,"_851":7411,"_839":6421,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":6414,"_851":7409,"_839":6416,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6411,"_843":6650,"_839":6413,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6408,"_843":7408,"_839":6410,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6405,"_843":7407,"_839":6407,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6402,"_843":7406,"_839":6404,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6399,"_843":6400,"_839":6401,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6397,"_843":200,"_839":6398,"_858":917},"Google Cloud","Source was inspected, not locally executed. go.mod requires Go 1.26.2, despite the README’s 1.24+ claim. The WASM route must compile public/cloud-crush.wasm, copy source assets into public/assets, and use the matching Go wasm_exec.js; the current public asset directory is incomplete. Cloud deployment is optional. The creator’s generation claim is distinct from independent code-authorship verification.","Complete game project: main.go contains rendering, match rules, input, game states, audio, and scores; assets/ is committed. Includes go.mod, server/main.go, public/index.html, wasm_exec.js, Dockerfile, and publisher gameplay screenshots. Native run: go run .; the case guide also records the browser build and asset-copy steps.",[7410],{"_841":6414,"_809":3603},[7412],{"_841":6419,"_809":3608},[7414],{"_841":6424,"_809":3618},"Ebitengine 2 · Go · WebAssembly",[3533],[706],"agent:claude-game-toolkit","claude-game-toolkit","Claude Code Game Toolkit · Canvas engine and templates","Combines Claude game-development commands and domain skills with a small JavaScript engine, playable genre templates, and examples that can be inspected as real code.","/agents/claude-game-toolkit/",{"_804":7419,"_805":7420,"_802":6919,"_3":7453,"_920":7451,"_6434":7421,"_197":7450,"_6421":7447,"_6416":7444,"_6410":7441,"_6407":7440,"_6401":2869,"_6413":6517,"_6404":7439,"_6398":200},[7425,7426,7427,7428,7429,7430,7431,7432,7433,7434,7435,7436,7437,7438],{"_837":805,"_843":7420,"_839":805,"_858":-7},{"_837":921,"_843":7421,"_839":6434,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6432,"_843":6918,"_839":802,"_858":909},{"_837":849,"_841":6430,"_898":2869,"_851":7452,"_839":3,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6428,"_843":7451,"_839":920,"_858":909},{"_837":854,"_841":6424,"_851":7448,"_839":197,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":6419,"_851":7445,"_839":6421,"_858":-7},{"_837":854,"_841":6414,"_851":7442,"_839":6416,"_858":-7},{"_837":838,"_841":6411,"_843":6504,"_839":6413,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6408,"_843":7441,"_839":6410,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6405,"_843":7440,"_839":6407,"_858":909},{"_837":838,"_841":6402,